- Replies now thread correctly in other clients (fixes replies drifting away from the original conversation)
- Content warnings now apply to replies, quotes and threads. The toggle shows its state clearly and you can add a reason
- In thread mode you can now review, edit and remove the parts you stacked. They survive closing the composer
- Search now finds users, on its own tab alongside posts
- Opening a post shows when it was posted and which app it came from
- The post "…" menu also shows the app it was posted from
